# Real Application Importance

State / Maintain state meaning - Why This Matters, Objects would be useless if they forgot everything immediately. State allows objects to: remember user info, track balances, store settings, maintain application data. Real Application Examples - Instagram user object state: username, followers count, profile picture; Shopping cart state: products in cart,total price; Bank account state: balance, account number; Game player state: health, score, inventory - SO meaning - what values something currently has OR the current data/condition of something at a specific moment.

Classes are HUGE because they help organize:

* data
* behavior
* logic

Instead of random variables everywhere.

